  - channelName: LoopForward
    priority: 6
    conditions:
    - variableKey: LoopForward
      comparison: 0
      value: 1
    narrations:
    - text: 'What do you think of this place? '
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b905bc3c46c884c88b9699033c37777c, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: Would you live here?
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f4ba7216d81b8461cb0a787fb2f0a2ac, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: 'You know... I built the whole thing myself. '
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2eed2654f6fcc43d1bb5bb280ad8e081, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: 'I built this place with my own precious hands. Brick by brick. '
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3757da38128fb4e8298a4bdf4b396404, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: I installed every lamp and placed every piece of furniture myself.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 99a1f4734401b4c1dbd478308d67a866, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: It ain't much, but it's honest work.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ca24bc8e8f9044ff1973b6d37605f429, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: Don't you feel welcomed and at east?
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4fcaa20d126e74e2081a832528776dcd, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: I think the residents of this place would say so.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 14a634ff85a6c4169827d09f8013000f, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    returnTransitions: []
    returnLinesCount: 1
    loopReturnTransitions: 0
    loopLastLine: 0
    disableChannelsOnComplete: []
    disableAllTransitionsOnComplete: 0
    disableTransitionsOnComplete: []
    disableIdleOnComplete: 0
  - channelName: LoopBackward
    priority: 6
    conditions:
    - variableKey: LoopBackward
      comparison: 0
      value: 1
    narrations:
    - text: No. No. Oh my god...
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e26e8186d246e4c428acb5c47f4a8415, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: Do you not understand the concept of a hallway?
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0b416548695624309bbd045ae9da2f08, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: In a hallway, you walk forward to get to a destination.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 957cad6756e00462e8f61f8a69a3c5c9, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: Extremely simple.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 27a63b7ad6926476ab960f4b5894d743, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: TURN AROUND!
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 39d60843df50b48db91efb2f75994d77, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    returnTransitions: []
    returnLinesCount: 1
    loopReturnTransitions: 0
    loopLastLine: 1
    disableChannelsOnComplete: []
    disableAllTransitionsOnComplete: 0
    disableTransitionsOnComplete: []
    disableIdleOnComplete: 0
  - channelName: LoopForward1
    priority: 6
    conditions:
    - variableKey: LoopForward1
      comparison: 0
      value: 1
    narrations:
    - text: "Wait. No... this isn\u2019t the way."
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 239286ee437d444039072dfed1f9fab6, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: 'You must have made the wrong turn. '
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b541a87a475594157aff69424e2222a8, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: 'Let me describe it to you in a way you understand. '
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4d3660ad630524efe91ca2b5d440dc59, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: Just follow the damn hallway. Can't be hard.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c26ed542e5f064b6999a241d67ebd9d8, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    - text: Don't even think of going back.
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1d9a38958bf0143b9b09780b478632d9, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
      discardOnInterrupt: 0
    returnTransitions: []
    returnLinesCount: 1
    loopReturnTransitions: 0
    loopLastLine: 0
    disableChannelsOnComplete: []
    disableAllTransitionsOnComplete: 0
    disableTransitionsOnComplete: []
    disableIdleOnComplete: 0
  - channelName: LoopBackward1
    priority: 6
    conditions:
    - variableKey: LoopBackward1
      comparison: 0
      value: 1
    narrations:
    - text: Did I not tell you to not go back?
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4dde7b7bf76ae4e25a18b5e732217070, type: 3}
      isImportant: 0
      destinationIfUnsaid: 
